url: "https://vweeks.github.io/scientific-agentic-engineering/"
abstract: >-
  A curated starter set of templates and examples for developing scientific
  software with AI coding agents: a scientific Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  server template, a Python units-checking skill, an adversarial-review agent
  configuration, and an example project instruction file. Developed as part
  of the 2026 Better Scientific Software (BSSw) Fellowship project
  "Maintaining Scientific Rigor in AI-Assisted Development: A
  Validation-Focused Methodology."
